@startuml ScanOneSample
skinparam BoxPadding 20

actor User as user

box "Instrument" #LightGrey
	participant Client #LightSkyBlue
	participant Client.Notifications.Services #LightSkyBlue
	participant gRPC #LightGreen
end box

box "Pharos-Server" #LightSkyBlue
	participant Application.Instrument.Grpc #LightGreen
	participant Application.Instrument.Commands
	participant Application.Infrastructure.Notifications
end box

'Scan one Sample'
user -> gRPC : Do something with samples (add, remove)

'Send instrument storage'
gRPC -> Application.Instrument.Grpc : grpc SendInstrumentStorageInformation
note over Application.Instrument.Grpc: PharosServiceImplementation.cs
Application.Instrument.Grpc -> Application.Instrument.Commands : Send ProcessInstrumentStorageInformationCommand
Application.Instrument.Commands -> Application.Infrastructure.Notifications : _instrumentStorageHub.SampleDrawerContentsChanged()
note over Application.Infrastructure.Notifications: Hubs\\
note over Application.Infrastructure.Notifications: Get group for this instrument, and send message.
Application.Infrastructure.Notifications --> Client: \r GetClientGroup(instrumentId).SampleDrawerContentsChanged(instrumentId); 
note over Client.Notifications.Services: Listening on\nIInstrumentStorageHub.SampleDrawerContentsChanged
Client.Notifications.Services --> Client.Notifications.Services: InstrumentStateNotificationProvider\n->\nInstrumentNotificationService

@enduml